     Throwing your own quest artifact at your quest leader
bypasses most of normal throwing.  It's not considered to
be an attack, and if the leader isn't paralyzed, he or she
will always catch it and not be angered.  If the leader is
already angry, he or she will keep the artifact, otherwise
it will be given back (directly into your inventory, so it
won't be dropped even if you're fumbling).

     If the leader is paralyzed, the artifact is dropped at
his/her feet.  A breakable object could be broken in that
situation.  I think the crystal balls are safe but Merlin's
Mirror is vulnerable.



